    "question": "Can a person actually talk with the agent while a step is running, or can the agent only leave questions to be answered later?",
    "answer": "A recipe can make any brewer step interactive (`\"interactive\": true` with a first `prompt`); `foedrum brew` on a terminal then opens the session for a person to talk in, and an open interactive session has no deadline. Under `serve` such a step waits Stuck for someone to open the session.",
