    "question": "If one of my test files is slow on my own laptop, will that make my local test run fail?",
    "answer": "No. Outside CI a file over its CPU-time budget or ceiling is only listed in the test file times block with the advice, and does not fail `npm test`; in CI the budget still fails the run.",
