    "answer": "In that repository itself: repository-layer house-yeast rules live in `.foedrum/house-yeast/` committed in the target repository and are approved by its owners in the bottle that introduces them. A repository can opt out with `houseYeast: \"brewery\"`, keeping them under the Brewery's `house-yeast/<repository>/`.",
