    "id": "recipe-06",
    "kind": "recipe",
    "question": "For a change that could affect a lot of the system, is the code review split across several reviewers or done by one?",
    "answer": "In Deep-brew, one Taster on the planner model reviews through all seven diff lenses together (correctness, acceptance, security, design conformance, test design, necessity, cross-platform). Its findings go back to Cellarman, two rounds per run, then the batch is Stuck.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "path": "defaults/recipes/deep-brew.jsonc",
