    "review": "model-triage"
  },
  {
    "id": "recipe-10",
    "kind": "recipe",
    "question": "What does the necessity lens check, and what counts as proof that a safeguard is needed?",
    "answer": "It reviews every safeguard a change adds (a guard, check step, retry, lock, review stage and the like) for proof that it is needed and not already done elsewhere. Proof is an observed failure (an issue, CI run, bug report, log or failing test) or a concrete path reachable today.",
